* neolang

** the form: modal + aspect (mandatory) + tense (mandatory) + person (mandatory in finite verbs) + root

** person markers
  |----|---------------------|------|-------------------|
  | ze | 1st person singular | zeze | 1st person plural |
  | me | 2nd person singular | meme | 2nd person plural |
  | te | 3rd person singular | keke | 3rd  personplural |
  |----|---------------------|------|-------------------|

** tense markers
  | ----- | --------- |
  | tar   | past      |
  | 0     | nonpast   |
  |-------|-----------|

** aspect markers
   |-------------|-----|
   | simple      | 0   |
   | progressive | ama |
   | perfective  | iza |
   | inchoative  | ono |
   | cessative   | gu  |
   | habitual    | ben |
   |-------------|-----|

** mode markers
   |------|----------|--------------|
   | aba  | finna    | intentive    |
   | hor  | tryna    | conative     |
   | fi   | wanna    | desiderative |
   | mugu | need to  | necessitive  |
   | ket  | oughta   | obligative   |
   | gib  | can      | abilitive    |
   | nana | maybe    | hypothetical |
   | pu   | negative | negative     |
   |------|----------|--------------|



   gar :: v :: see
   baj :: v :: throw
   jag :: v :: hit
   kal :: v :: run
   bor :: v :: feel love towards
   nir :: v :: to be at (a location)
   nun :: v :: hold, hold on to

   tartegar :: past.3s.see :: she saw
   tartetegar :: past.3p.see :: they saw
   izatartetegar :: perfective.past.3p.see :: they have seen
   punizatartetegar :: negative.perfective.past.3p.see :: they have not seen

   ketezekal :: I ought to run
   abazekal :: I'm finna run

